<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Trade Avata"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell article-body"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1><p class="lead">How Trade Avata handles account, platform and support information.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="shell article-body"><h2>Information we collect</h2><p>Trade Avata may process account details, learning progress, product access, support messages and data users choose to store in platform features.</p><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information is used to provide the service, maintain account access, support platform features, improve reliability and respond to support requests.</p><h2>Connected services</h2><p>Where external services such as authentication, payments, email or trading-platform connections are enabled, their own terms and privacy practices may also apply.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>Users can contact Trade Avata support regarding account or privacy questions. Final production policy should be reviewed for the jurisdictions where the service operates.</p></div></section></BaseLayout>
